<title>USA: Cityscape issues $50 million preferred shares.</title>
<headline>Cityscape issues $50 million preferred shares.</headline>
<dateline>ELMSFORD, N.Y. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cityscape Financial Corp said on Thursday it has completed a private placement of $50 million of six percent convertible preferred stock.</p>
<p>Cityscape said terms of the convertible preferred stock will be found in the 8-K form it is filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission on April 10, 1997.</p>
